## Separazione Responsabilità CORRETTA

### 🏗️ Classe PHP InlineDatePicker (LOGICA)
```php
class InlineDatePicker extends DatePicker
{
    // ✅ TUTTE le responsabilità logiche
    public function generateCalendarData(): array        // Genera calendario
    public function getEnabledDates(): Collection        // Date abilitate  
    public function getLocalizedWeekdays(): array        // Localizzazione
    public function previousMonth(): void                // Navigazione prev
    public function nextMonth(): void                    // Navigazione next
    public function getViewData(): array                 // Prepara dati vista
}
```

### 🎛️ Widget (COORDINAMENTO)
```php
class FindDoctorAndAppointmentWidget extends XotBaseWidget
{
    // ✅ Metodi wrapper che delegano al componente
    public function previousMonth(): void {
        $dateComponent = $this->form->getComponent('wizard.date.appointment_date');
        $dateComponent->previousMonth();
    }
    
    public function nextMonth(): void {
        $dateComponent = $this->form->getComponent('wizard.date.appointment_date');
        $dateComponent->nextMonth();
    }
}
```

